g?resize=932%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 932w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=680%2C1095&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1095\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?w=1047&amp;ssl=1 1047w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=320%2C515&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=600%2C966&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=240%2C386&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=768%2C1237&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta10.jpg?resize=954%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 954w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=680%2C1098&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1098\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?w=1055&amp;ssl=1 1055w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=320%2C517&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=600%2C969&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=240%2C387&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=768%2C1240&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta8.jpg?resize=952%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 952w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=680%2C1123&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1123\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?w=1034&amp;ssl=1 1034w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=320%2C528&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=600%2C991&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=240%2C396&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=768%2C1268&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta5.jpg?resize=930%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 930w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=680%2C1091&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1091\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?w=1062&amp;ssl=1 1062w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=320%2C513&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=600%2C963&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=240%2C385&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=768%2C1232&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta4.jpg?resize=957%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 957w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=680%2C1110&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1110\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?w=1050&amp;ssl=1 1050w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=320%2C522&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=600%2C979&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=240%2C392&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=768%2C1254&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta2.jpg?resize=941%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 941w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=680%2C1098&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"1098\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?w=1056&amp;ssl=1 1056w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=320%2C517&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=600%2C969&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=240%2C388&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=768%2C1240&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta1.jpg?resize=951%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 951w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cosmotheoros-Christiaan-Huygens/dp/8494256548?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cosmotheoros_alejandraacosta15.jpg?w=680&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></p>\n<p>Without the concept at the center of <em>Cosmotheoros</em>, we wouldn’t have one of the finest metaphors in all of literature: “There is nothing new under the sun,” Octavia Butler wrote, “but there are new suns.” </p>\n<hr /><h3>donating = loving</h3><p>For seventeen years, I have been spending hundreds of hours and thousands of dollars each month composing <em>The Marginalian</em> (which <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/10/22/brain-pickings-becoming-the-marginalian/\">bore the outgrown name <em>Brain Pickings</em></a> for its first fifteen years). It has remained free and ad-free and alive thanks to patronage from readers. I have no staff, no interns, no assistant — a thoroughly one-woman labor of love that is also my life and my livelihood. If this labor makes your own life more livable in any way, please consider lending a helping hand with a <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/donate/\">donation</a>. Your support makes all the difference.</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<h3>newsletter</h3>\n<p><em>The Marginalian</em> has a free weekly newsletter. It comes out on Sundays and offers the week’s most inspiring reading. Here’s <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/brainpickings/janna-levin-rebecca-elson-anne-lamott-james-gleick\">what to expect</a>. Like? <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/newsletter/\">Sign up.</a></p>","author":"Maria Popova","siteTitle":"The Marginalian","siteHash":"052ac1be0de11784b9ef27664fbcf33da8263d0e7cb9c6e601ccd959f2d3aa78","entryHash":"85609e257f15535b8eeb913deb1d89d1e15a8e6de0d5e2dff522d61c745b4c86","category":"Sites"}